                <pb facs="0879" n="747" sameAs="frus:frus1926v01/pg747"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A4e/579: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American
                    Delegation</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-04-28T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 28,
                                1926—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>20. I approve attitude outlined in paragraph 2 of your telegram number 33 of
                    April 26, 6 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
